    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. one more thing—i've heard st pancras can be a bit of a nightmare to navigate if you've got a lot of stuff. is the layout of the station pretty straightforward or is it kind of a maze? i don't want to get lost or end up stuck in a weird corner while trying to find the gates.",
